title: "Chinese Internet and ICT Reports QA Dataset / 中文互联网与 ICT 报告问答数据集"
version: 2.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
authors:
  - family-names: Dong
    given-names: Tingshuo
url: https://github.com/dongtingshuo/chinese-internet-and-ict-reports-qa-dataset
repository-code: https://github.com/dongtingshuo/chinese-internet-and-ict-reports-qa-dataset
license: other
abstract: >-
  A source-grounded Chinese QA dataset with mixed record-level licenses. The v2.2.0
  release contains a 2,355-record Gold subset selected through source-grounded AI
  review, owner-attested independent human review, and adjudication. Review-method
  disclosures and scope are documented; the label is not an external certification.
